auditPattern("Specialize in heavy armor! Armor damage taken is reduced by a percentage equal to [color=#135213]5%[/color] of the current total armor value of both body and head armor. The heavier your armor and helmet, the more you benefit.", "重装備を極める！ 攻撃で受ける装甲ダメージを、現在の頭部と胴体の装甲値合計の[color=#135213]5%[/color]に等しい割合だけ軽減する。胴防具と兜の装甲値が高いほど効果は大きい。", "unit:FE31BDCAC575D5E19D34BEE1");
auditPattern("This character has been charmed. He no longer has any control over his actions and is a puppet that has no choice but to obey his master. Wears off in [color=#8f1e1e]3[/color] turn(s).\n\nThe higher a character's resolve, the higher the chance to resist being charmed.", "この団員は魅了されている。もはや自分の行動を制御できず、主人の命令に従うほかない操り人形となった。あと[color=#8f1e1e]3[/color]ターンで効果が切れる。\n\n精神力が高いほど、魅了に抵抗できる確率も高くなる。", "unit:FA8CAB417DED92B7E654363E");
auditPattern("This character has been chilled to the bone by cold. With their limbs frozen stiff, it takes a great deal of effort to move in a coordinated fashion. The effect will slowly wear off over [color=#8f1e1e]2[/color] more turn(s).", "この団員は冷気に骨の髄まで凍え、四肢がこわばっているため、思うように体を動かすにも大きな労力を要する。効果はあと[color=#8f1e1e]2[/color]ターンかけて徐々に薄れる。", "unit:65AFD68FFAFC020AEBDAF209");
auditPattern("This character has been temporarily disarmed for [color=#8f1e1e]1[/color] more turn(s) and is unable to use any weapon skills. Switching to a different weapon will remove this effect immediately.", "この団員はあと[color=#8f1e1e]1[/color]ターンの間、一時的に武装解除され、武器スキルを使用できない。別の武器へ持ち替えると、この効果は即座に解除される。", "unit:9202FFC7EA72DCF8EF588734");
auditPattern("This character has received so heavy a blow that they are dazed, confused and gasping for air. Will wear off in [color=#8f1e1e]2[/color] turn(s).", "この団員は強烈な一撃を受け、朦朧とし、混乱して息を切らしている。あと[color=#8f1e1e]2[/color]ターンで効果が切れる。", "unit:CB84427F29B10C8E49AA0F7D");
auditPattern("This character has taken antidote and is immune to any kind of poison for another [color=#8f1e1e]2[/color] turn(s).", "この団員は解毒剤を服用しており、あと[color=#8f1e1e]2[/color]ターンはあらゆる毒に免疫を持つ。", "unit:E5FACA37148048E32E15BAFA");
auditPattern("This character is adapting fast to their opponent's moves and gains an additional [color=#135213]+10%[/color] chance to hit with any attack.", "敵の動きに素早く適応しており、あらゆる攻撃の命中率がさらに[color=#135213]+10%[/color]上昇する。", "unit:694283EC07524071AC3AE4DB");
auditPattern("This character is bleeding profusely from a recently received wound and will lose [color=#8f1e1e]5[/color] hitpoints each turn for [color=#8f1e1e]2[/color] more turn(s).", "この団員は負ったばかりの傷から激しく出血しており、毎ターン体力を[color=#8f1e1e]5[/color]失う。この出血はあと[color=#8f1e1e]2[/color]ターン続く。", "unit:6D68AADE28877F0AD7686398");
auditPattern("This character is using the superior reach of their melee weapon to keep opponents at bay, increasing Melee Defense by [color=#135213]+5[/color] until their next turn.", "近接武器の長い間合いで敵を寄せつけず、次の自分のターンまで近接防御が[color=#135213]+5[/color]上昇している。", "unit:E846864F21CCC5C313C766D9");
auditPattern("This character was on the receiving end of a dirty trick. Distracted for [color=#8f1e1e]1[/color] more turn(s), they are slower to react and have a harder time landing clean strikes.", "この団員は卑劣な手口を食らった。あと[color=#8f1e1e]1[/color]ターンの間は注意をそらされ、反応が鈍り、正確な一撃を当てにくくなる。", "unit:B138A8561E6D656DE690C30A");
auditPattern("This character's armor has been sprayed with a Lindwurm's acidic blood, which is now slowly eating away at it for another [color=#8f1e1e]3[/color] turn(s).", "この団員の防具にはリントヴルムの酸性の血が浴びせられ、あと[color=#8f1e1e]3[/color]ターンかけて徐々に侵食される。", "unit:6B1EB958AE4F995CB291B4EB");
